# Accepted Trivy findings for the release gate (#1009).
#
# The release fails on any unignored CRITICAL or HIGH image finding.
# Add an entry only after a maintainer has reviewed the finding, and keep
# the reason next to it:
#
#   # <why it is accepted: not reachable, no fix upstream, ...> (#<issue>)
#   CVE-YYYY-NNNNN exp:YYYY-MM-DD
#
# `exp:` makes the exception expire so it is reviewed again.
